{"path":"chrono/month_day/ok","title":"std::chrono::month_day::ok","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::month_day::</span>ok","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/month_day/ok","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Determines whether this month_day stores a valid month-day combination.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> ok<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Determines whether this <code>month_day</code> stores a valid month-day combination.\n</p><p>The combination is valid if <span class=\"t-lc\">month()</span> represents a valid month (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">month<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>), <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span>day<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code>, and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">unsigned</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span>day<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;=</span> D</span></code>, where D is the number of days in the month represented by <code>month()</code>. The number of days in February is considered to be 29.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the month and day combination is valid, otherwise false.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1781\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> md1<span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2628\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">July</span></span></a><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><span class=\"nu0\">15</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>md1.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month_day\"><span class=\"kw2606\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month_day</span></span></a> md2<span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2621\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">month</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">14</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/day\"><span class=\"kw2620\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">day</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">42</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>md2.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> md3<span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/month\"><span class=\"kw2623\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">February</span></span></a><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><span class=\"nu0\">29</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>md3.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>true false true</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chron